<title>UK: IBCA gives St.Petersburg dlr issue BB plus l-term.</title>
<headline>IBCA gives St.Petersburg dlr issue BB plus l-term.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Thursday it had assigned its BB plus long term rating to the City of St. Petersburg $300 million 9.5 percent semi-annual bonds due 2002.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44-171-542 8663</p>
